<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_fim_importer_1autotoc_md7_1s1"><sect2 id="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_fim_importer_1autotoc_md7">
<title>Supported input formats</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>FIM catalogue XML (<computeroutput>&lt;prozessbibliothek&gt;</computeroutput> root element) containing one or more <computeroutput>&lt;prozess&gt;</computeroutput> entries whose body is a BPMN 2.0 XML fragment.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Individual FIM BPMN 2.0 XML files (delegated to <ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_bpmn_serializer" kindref="compound">BpmnSerializer</ref>).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>FITKO REST API responses (JSON envelope wrapping a BPMN XML payload).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
